		"name": "SalaryNeeds - Complete Customer & Booking APIs",
		"description": "Production-grade Postman collection for SalaryNeeds platform containing Customer Profile, Address Management, Service Catalog, Worker Discovery, and Booking Lifecycle RESTful APIs.",
